# Normalise line endings.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites every file to CRLF and a Linux CI run then sees the
# whole repository as modified — which breaks the "permission matrix is current" check and makes
# every diff unreadable. Text files are stored LF in the repository and checked out LF
# everywhere; the few files that genuinely require CRLF are marked explicitly.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary

